.layers but no .model. Model runner v2's load_eagle_model dereferenced
target_language_model.model and the EAGLE engine failed to start:

    AttributeError: 'ApertusModel' object has no attribute 'model'
      vllm/v1/worker/gpu/spec_decode/eagle/utils.py:52

